Another popular item to dip is a spare unicorn horn. If it's polymorph,
chances are that it'll change into another magical tool, like a horn or
other instrument, or a magic marker. If it's sickness, the potion will
also be identified, since it'll change into fruit juice.

If it's blindness, confusion or hallucination, the potion will change into
water. You won't know which of the three it is, but anyway, it's
detrimental.

